WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:05.730
Speaker 1: . Bernie Sanders almost immediately
after the Derrick Shervin verdict, again,

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:11.820
three guilty counts, potentially decades in
prison, sentencing in eight weeks.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:16.420
Bernie Sanders using similar language to that
which many are using.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:21.380
And many of our viewers used on the live stream
where we covered the verdict that the SHERVIN

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:28.329
verdict is accountability, but it is not justice
and it does not fix issues of systemic racism

00:00:28.329 --> 00:00:29.329
in the United States.

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:31.589
Bernie Sanders sending a few tweets.

00:00:31.589 --> 00:00:36.480
Let's look at them saying, quote, The jury's
verdict delivers accountability for Derek

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:40.190
Shervin, but not justice for George Floyd.

00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:44.699
Real justice for him and to many others can
only happen when we build a nation that fund.

00:00:44.699 --> 00:00:50.019
A mentally respects the human dignity of every
person, Bernie, going on to say the trauma

00:00:50.019 --> 00:00:53.370
and tragedy of George Floyds murder must never
leave us.

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:58.100
It was a manifestation of a system that callously
devalues the lives of black people.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:03.859
Finally, Bernie, saying, our struggle now
is about justice, not justice on paper, but

00:01:03.859 --> 00:01:07.590
real justice in which all Americans live their
lives free of oppression.

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:13.390
We must boldly root out the cancer of systemic
racism and police violence against people

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:14.430
of color.

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:17.730
So certainly this is a step forward.

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:28.540
If it is a new era of more police understanding
that they are in a position as police officers

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:34.220
that can be dangerous for them, there's no
denying that they are in a position where

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:40.570
they are put into situations that are, by
their nature, difficult and that require exercising

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:46.940
judgment about what is the risk to them and
to others of the individuals that they encounter.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:55.140
But the sort of free pass or close to free
pass that it's not my opinion that statistically

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:59.820
there has been understandings over the last
decade and a half.

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:05.800
As I mentioned earlier, out of 140 cases of
charges against officers for murder or manslaughter,

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:12.609
of the 97 cases that have been resolved, seven
guilty verdicts, OK, that this may be a change

00:02:12.609 --> 00:02:15.969
in terms of what they can get away with.

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:21.599
And much like when Barack Obama was elected
president, it didn't end racism.

00:02:21.599 --> 00:02:28.129
In fact, it it arguably coalesced racism and
xenophobia and subsequently led to Donald

00:02:28.129 --> 00:02:29.549
Trump.

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:31.689
Understand the backwards nature of that.

00:02:31.689 --> 00:02:38.099
This is potentially a step forward, but pervasive
ignorance is not going anywhere anytime soon.

00:02:38.099 --> 00:02:39.280
It is maybe the start.

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:40.829
It is maybe a glimmer of hope.

00:02:40.829 --> 00:02:46.749
It would be great if it were true that this
was some major resolution to America's problems.

00:02:46.749 --> 00:02:47.749
But it's not.

00:02:47.749 --> 00:02:52.140
And again, I want to repeat something that
I mentioned in the first segment about the

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:53.140
verdict.

00:02:53.140 --> 00:03:00.680
It is an odd situation where you have the
state of Minnesota saying we are going to

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:04.230
deal with what we believe is a wrong that
was committed.

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:05.230
Right.

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:10.390
The state saying from what we saw, we we are
charging Derek Chauvin and we are prosecuting

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:12.209
Derrick Chauvin.

00:03:12.209 --> 00:03:19.560
But Derrick Chauvin is, at least in a sense,
a consequence of the policing system overseen

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:21.750
by that very same state of Minnesota.

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:25.280
And you can make a similar analogy to other
states around the country, different states

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:29.760
dealing with issues of police force to different
degrees.

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:35.530
So we are now going to have to see what what
is next.

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:42.870
President Joe Biden speaking last night alongside
Kamala Harris and others and saying we we

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:47.159
now have a problem that hopefully we can start
to deal with.

00:03:47.159 --> 00:03:51.159
And the question of how is it going to be
dealt with and to what degree and will police

00:03:51.159 --> 00:03:55.060
departments play a role as part of the solution
or not?

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:59.169
And of course, police departments aren't one
thing and there are dramatically different

00:03:59.169 --> 00:04:01.090
police departments in the United States.

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:05.150
Just as a reminder disclaimer, I know people
get mad when I do this.

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:07.349
I am not an abolish the police guy.

00:04:07.349 --> 00:04:09.109
I am a reformed the police guy.

00:04:09.109 --> 00:04:13.670
And I have extensive clips on our YouTube
channel about why that's my framework.

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:18.020
This is not you know, I know that there were
some who reacted to this by saying all cops

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:20.310
are bastards, abolish the police.

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:22.900
This guilty verdict proves we get rid of police.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:25.160
Go talk to them if you want to figure out
why they think that.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.160
That's not my view.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:31.050
I've made clear, you know, my eight to ten
point plan of police reforms that that I would

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:32.050
